      "id": "sign-four-lore-source",
      "categoryId": "sign-four-lore-edition",
      "title": "Source Edition",
      "body": "Arthur Conan Doyle, The Sign of the Four, Project Gutenberg eBook #2097, English UTF-8 plain text, released 1 March 2000, updated 6 April 2026. https://www.gutenberg.org/cache/epub/2097/pg2097.txt. SHA-256: 4cdea89cf6cd2567a556d0e6901edb89949dd79e200dbaf4ced4cabf1d5d2c26. First published in 1890. The Project Gutenberg catalogue marks the text public domain in the United States. The twelve narrative chapters and their headings are retained in full; the Gutenberg header, displayed title/byline, contents list, end marker and licence are excluded.",
      "visibleFromEventId": "sign-four-event-1-1",
      "tags": [],
      "coverImageId": null,
      "linkedEntityIds": []
    },
    {
      "worldId": "sign-of-the-four-world",
      "createdAt": 1791072000000,
      "updatedAt": 1791072000000,
      "id": "sign-four-lore-calendar",
      "categoryId": "sign-four-lore-edition",
      "title": "Editorial Calendar",
      "body": "The invitation envelope is postmarked 7 July, while the journey it prompts is described as a September evening. This edition follows the witnessed September setting and uses 1888 as an editorial year to provide a navigable calendar. Exact dates and gaps are approximate.",
      "visibleFromEventId": "sign-four-event-1-1",
      "tags": [],
      "coverImageId": null,
      "linkedEntityIds": []
    },
    {
      "worldId": "sign-of-the-four-world",
      "createdAt": 1791072000000,
      "updatedAt": 1791072000000,
      "id": "sign-four-lore-maps",
      "categoryId": "sign-four-lore-edition",
      "title": "Map Method",
      "body": "The London and Thames charts represent the narrated route approximately. Baker Street and the Lodge plans are invented from described movement, not surveyed architecture. The Lodge’s three aligned views show its grounds, upper storey and roof; their dimensions are editorial approximations.",
      "visibleFromEventId": "sign-four-event-1-1",
      "tags": [],
      "coverImageId": null,
      "linkedEntityIds": []
    },
